# TLS profile table. Exact match on the whole key.
# Format: <key> <config-basename>
# Keys are either a concrete profile name (commercial/2025) or a partition the sandbox
# sends as AWS_LAMBDA_TLS_PROFILE (aws, aws-cn). All partitions resolve to
# commercial-2025 for now.

# Profile names
commercial/2025    commercial-2025
commercial/2026    commercial-2026
cnsa               cnsa-1.0
cnsa/1.0           cnsa-1.0

# Partitions
aws                commercial-2025
aws-cn             commercial-2025
aws-us-gov         commercial-2025
aws-iso            commercial-2025
aws-iso-b          commercial-2025
aws-iso-e          commercial-2025
aws-iso-f          commercial-2025
aws-eusc           commercial-2025
